                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jila Qit'a bukho inqamne tolfad'i. Anini yayu siti hime, aka atini jia Abibu keesa guyya torba qit'a bukho inqamne nyaattu wonti akanatiifi jia suni keesa lafa Misiri keesaa baate.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.18",
