              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eegi anini gosa d'ibi si duraa kaase lafa tante si ballise, nami tokoleeni gaafa atini jila sadeeni suni tolfattu si inhad'u.",
